WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.564
Quad9 pulled their

00:00:01.376 --> 00:00:02.484
DNS service from

00:00:02.296 --> 00:00:03.050
France

00:00:03.582 --> 00:00:05.056
Quad9 has withdrawn

00:00:04.867 --> 00:00:06.046
its DNS service

00:00:05.858 --> 00:00:06.789
from France

00:00:06.928 --> 00:00:08.319
The policymakers and

00:00:08.131 --> 00:00:09.180
courts of France

00:00:08.992 --> 00:00:09.888
may of course

00:00:09.747 --> 00:00:11.185
make any determination

00:00:10.997 --> 00:00:11.704
they wish

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:12.706
even those that

00:00:12.518 --> 00:00:13.932
seem ineffective or

00:00:13.756 --> 00:00:14.652
damaging in our

00:00:14.464 --> 00:00:15.053
view

00:00:15.574 --> 00:00:18.451
Today November 24 2026

00:00:18.581 --> 00:00:20.031
Quad9 will disable

00:00:19.843 --> 00:00:21.057
services for French

00:00:20.869 --> 00:00:21.576
users

00:00:22.094 --> 00:00:23.391
Quad9 blocks a

00:00:23.203 --> 00:00:24.464
set of cyber-threats

00:00:24.299 --> 00:00:26.846
on 9.9.9.9 for

00:00:26.752 --> 00:00:27.601
end users

00:00:27.743 --> 00:00:28.662
where the outcome

00:00:28.474 --> 00:00:29.134
would be an

00:00:29.075 --> 00:00:30.749
unexpected and harmful

00:00:30.561 --> 00:00:31.398
result to the

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:32.058
end user

00:00:32.598 --> 00:00:33.612
Full story on

00:00:33.423 --> 00:00:34.319
the dashboard
